                <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle 宠物寄养预约与履约 · 端到端时序图（v2.3.0）\n\nskinparam defaultFontName \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam sequenceMessageAlign center\nskinparam maxMessageSize 180\nscale 0.85\n\nparticipant \&quot;主人\&quot; as O\nparticipant \&quot;机构\&quot; as S\nparticipant \&quot;后台\&quot; as A\nparticipant \&quot;Go API\&quot; as API\nparticipant \&quot;数据库\&quot; as DB\n\n== 下单与支付 ==\nO -&gt; API: 创建订单\nAPI -&gt; DB: 事务：锁行→占容量→写快照\nDB --&gt; API: 订单号与金额\nAPI --&gt; O: 待支付\nO -&gt; API: 支付\nAPI -&gt; DB: 写支付 + 流水\nAPI --&gt; O: 已预约\n\n== 接单与履约 ==\nS -&gt; API: 接单\nAPI -&gt; DB: 状态→已接单\nS -&gt; API: 发布动态\nAPI -&gt; DB: 写动态 + 通知\nO -&gt; API: 查看动态\n\n== 完成与结算 ==\nS -&gt; API: 完成订单\nAPI -&gt; DB: 完成 + 归还容量\nO -&gt; API: 评价\nAPI -&gt; DB: 写评价 + 聚合评分\nS -&gt; API: 回复 / 结算申请\nA -&gt; API: 审核结算\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="9Tn1eCuFdMZWc3J5G9KJ-1">
